{"id":"db96cabedd089e5f","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-program-coding.md","title":"Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs","display":"df-effective-machine-encoding — Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-program-coding","aliases":["73-df-binary-program-coding","73-df-effective-machine-encoding"],"display":"df-effective-machine-encoding — Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","[[73-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-program-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-program-coding</span><span>73-df-effective-machine-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-machine-encoding — Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordCoding}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lex}\">\\(\\mathrm{lex}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\">\\(\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a>；规范转移表按状态、带字符的数值字典序排列。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是候选六元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}\\)</span> 的右侧对其全部分量存在量化。使用编码记号时，固定满足该谓词的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{decode},\\operatorname{esc},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{unpair})\">\\(\\mathcal E=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{decode},\\operatorname{esc},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{unpair})\\)</span>，各名称指该固定元组的相应分量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 是方向编码函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_j\">\\(\\pi_j\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 开始编号的有限元组投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{esc}\">\\(\\operatorname{esc}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}\\)</span> 是下述固定函数；包分量必须等于这些函数，而不是任意注入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{blank}\">\\(\\mathrm{blank}\\)</span> 是机器八元组中的空白字符分量，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a>；在下述存在量词内取被量化机器的对应分量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\n\\Bigl[M=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\n\\Bigl[M=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}:\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\},\\qquad\n\\iota\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L,0),(\\mathsf R,1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}:\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\},\\qquad\n\\iota\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L,0),(\\mathsf R,1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},e\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\nM=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\\\\n{}\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\\\\n{}\\land\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}(\\{\\langle q,a\\rangle:q\\in Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\land a\\in\\Gamma\\},e)\\\\\n{}\\land\\tau=\\langle r,g,\\mathrm{blank},q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\n\\left\\langle\\pi_1\\delta(\\pi_1e(i),\\pi_2e(i)),\\pi_2\\delta(\\pi_1e(i),\\pi_2e(i)),\n\\iota(\\pi_3\\delta(\\pi_1e(i),\\pi_2e(i)))\\right\\rangle\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},e\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\nM=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\\\\n{}\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\\\\n{}\\land\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}(\\{\\langle q,a\\rangle:q\\in Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\land a\\in\\Gamma\\},e)\\\\\n{}\\land\\tau=\\langle r,g,\\mathrm{blank},q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\n\\left\\langle\\pi_1\\delta(\\pi_1e(i),\\pi_2e(i)),\\pi_2\\delta(\\pi_1e(i),\\pi_2e(i)),\n\\iota(\\pi_3\\delta(\\pi_1e(i),\\pi_2e(i)))\\right\\rangle\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tab}\\coloneqq\n\\{(M,\\tau)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tab}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\to\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tab}\\coloneqq\n\\{(M,\\tau)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tab}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\to\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{esc}:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(xb)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\,0b\n\\quad(x\\in\\mathbf2^*,\\ b\\in\\mathbf2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{esc}:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(xb)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\,0b\n\\quad(x\\in\\mathbf2^*,\\ b\\in\\mathbf2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\,11\\,y\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\,11\\,y\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e,c,d,s,p,u\\;\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal E=(e,c,d,s,p,u)\\land\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\\\\n{}\\land c=\\{(M,e(\\operatorname{tab}(M))):M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\}\n\\land c:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\\\\n{}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\n\\land d=\\{(z,M)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}:(M,z)\\in c\\}\\\\\n{}\\land d:\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\to\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\n\\land d\\circ c=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}}\\\\\n{}\\land s=\\operatorname{esc}\\land p=\\operatorname{pair}\n\\land p:(\\mathbf2^*)^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\\\\n{}\\land u=\\{(p(x,y),(x,y)):x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*\\}\n\\land u:\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\to(\\mathbf2^*)^2\n\\land u\\circ p=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\mathbf2^*)^2}\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e,c,d,s,p,u\\;\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal E=(e,c,d,s,p,u)\\land\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\\\\n{}\\land c=\\{(M,e(\\operatorname{tab}(M))):M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\}\n\\land c:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\\\\n{}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\n\\land d=\\{(z,M)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}:(M,z)\\in c\\}\\\\\n{}\\land d:\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\to\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\n\\land d\\circ c=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}}\\\\\n{}\\land s=\\operatorname{esc}\\land p=\\operatorname{pair}\n\\land p:(\\mathbf2^*)^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\\\\n{}\\land u=\\{(p(x,y),(x,y)):x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*\\}\n\\land u:\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\to(\\mathbf2^*)^2\n\\land u\\circ p=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\mathbf2^*)^2}\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}(M)\n\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}),\\qquad\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}(M)\n\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}),\\qquad\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;(L(S)=L(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;(L(S)=L(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>状态与带字符仍重命名为有限自然数初段，表头、转移字段次序和配对公式均保留。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordCoding}\\)</span> 的有效性由内部文件 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a> 提供，而非依赖未给出的外部文档。</p>\n<p>配对反解只能从开头按两位一组扫描；第一段对齐的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"11\">\\(11\\)</span> 是分隔符。反函数使用明确的图定义，非法编码不获得任意机器值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}\\)</span> 显式约束包内的转义与配对分量，不能用一个任意注入替换固定递归函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14